		<talent3Name>Light</talent3Name>
		<talent3Desc>Without light talents you'd be in the dark. It's scary there. Light talents shine.</talent3Desc>

		<talent4Name>Water</talent4Name>
		<talent4Desc>Water talents love to splash and have fun in the water and make it rain and so on and so forth</talent4Desc>

		<talent5Name>Tinker</talent5Name>
		<talent5Desc>Tinker talents are great, but I am getting tired of making placeholder text</talent5Desc>


